# Three creature cards in Bot1's graveyard (two Ornithopters discarded to Faithless Looting, a third Bolted on the battlefield)
# are enough on their own (CR 603.4): turn 3's surveil keeps the Island on top, and the Researcher still becomes prepared, a
# copy of Reanimate in exile; turn 5 surveils again while it is prepared, and there is still one copy (CR 722.3a).

